Change: Validate usernames from the `--proxy-auth-username` header

With `--proxy-auth-username`, rest-server accepted any username from the
configured header. Usernames from the header must now consist of letters,
digits and the characters `@`, `.`, `_` and `-`, like usernames in
`.htpasswd`. Requests with any other username are rejected.

https://github.com/restic/rest-server/pull/415
